// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_FLynn_DeliverTask1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AugustReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2749471936" "Justin Augustine's Report"
// DetailString :
"P97752693" "This report details Justin Augustine's ongoing attempts to research the nature of the mysterious Chantry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1476108313" "I have a bit of trouble, {HeroName}, and I'm hoping you can help me out. I have a man missing. One of my scouts, Justin Augustine, hasn't reported in for a while. Justin's got all kinds a weird magic-wizard abilities or something. Ritual wizardry he calls it, but it usually keeps him safe from harm and invisible to bad guys. This time, though, I'm getting worried. He went to investigate the region beyond the cascades, and I haven't heard from him since. We're scheduled to contact him soon, and I'd feel better if I knew someone capable would <A HREF={ACCEPT}>be there to meet him,</A> just in case something's happened."
// AcceptString :
"P1257426762" "Meet with Justin Augustine."
// SendOffString :
"P178929270" "Augustine's a good guy, if a bit weird. I just hope he's safe. He has a bad habit of getting too close to things that even his magic won't protect him from."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P306596246" "Find Justin Augustine"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P896204953" "I only hope you find Augustine alive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2199052934" "Wasn't expecting to meet you, {HeroName}, but this could be advantageous. My Tarot was pretty good this morning and all, and this meeting might be that. <br><br>Well, I'm Justin Augustine, working as a scout and magical expert here with the Shadow Shard Expeditionary force. Let me guess, ol' Flynn was getting all worried about me, wasn't he? He acts like he's the world's most laid-back commando, but he always gets worked up whenever he feels powerless. He's just real good at not letting on, you know? <br><br>Anyway, I'm still fine out here, I've just started studying this 'Chantry' place. It's fascinating, it really is. I'll probably be out here for a while, so do me a favor and get my report back to the the Lt. Col. so he can relax a bit. <br><br>Oh, and maybe later, if you can get a good number of friends together, I may have a pretty big job for you. Let me know if you're interested."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1476628260" "Thanks for doing that, {HeroName}. Good to know Justin hasn't gotten himself killed yet. And thanks for bringing back the report, too. I've heard rumors of the Chantry, but I haven't been able to see it in person. It really looks pretty amazing, huh? I wonder what the story is with that place? Maybe Augustine will need some help finding out later."

