// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1176046845" "Well, {HeroName}, it looks like some old friends have started making the rounds all the way out here in the Cascades, and by old friends I mean bitter enemies. The Nemesis Army has been trying to build up bases all over the area, and I for one don't want them hanging their dirty brass laundry around and lowering property values. Unfortunately, I don't have the manpower to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take out a small Nemesis Army base</A> and protect Mole Point Charlie. That's where you come in."
// AcceptString :
"P3901990398" "Take out a small Nemesis Army base"
// SendOffString :
"P1281737881" "Glad to hear you're willing to help. Now, since this is a pretty small installation, the best bet is probably to just hit it hard and defeat all of the Nemesis forces in there. Should be easy for you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1348280400" "Defeat all Nemesis in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P505038319" "You'll need to defeat all of the Nemesis Army forces in that base to really take it out. Last thing we want is for them to get comfortable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2717442526" "It seems that Lt. Col. Flynn's  information about a Nemesis Army base was right on the mark."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P798536038" "You defeated all of the Nemesis Army forces in the base, destroying it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P773912944" "You are an efficient one, aren't you {HeroName}? That takes care of one hidden Nemesis Army base. Now there are probably just a few dozen more."

