// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3265644175" "Those Nemesis Army guys are acting up again. Probably because they think they have a medium sized secret base out here, so they figure they have all kinds of supplies and a safe retreat. Well, they're wrong and they're right about that. They do have a base, and it does have all kinds of supplies for them. But they're wrong if they think that it's secret. I'd also like to make them wrong about thinking it's a safe retreat, but I don't have the manpower to handle that and protect this facility. If only there was someone with paranormal or metahuman abilities willing to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>smash the Nemesis Army's base and destroy their supplies</A>. But what are the odds of that?"
// AcceptString :
"P1186200729" "Smash the Nemesis Army base and destroy their supplies."
// SendOffString :
"P1215109662" "A hero willing to fight the Nemesis Army, right at my doorstep. What are the odds? <br><br>Okay, {HeroName}, here's what you have to do: It's a medium sized base, so it should still be small enough for you to defeat all of the Nemesis Army forces in there. In addition, you'll need to find all of their supply caches and destroy them to keep them from being re-captured by later raids by the Nemesis Army. I wish we could take them, but I can't run the risk that they're trapped."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3391643063" "You need to defeat all of the Nemesis Army in that base and destroy all of their supplies. Otherwise, it's not a win."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2167829031" "This Nemesis Army base seems well supplied. Time to change that."

