// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P571770227" "I'm a big believer in letting people do their thing, but I get bent out of shape when that 'thing' is kidnapping people and trying to sacrifice their souls to demons. Unfortunately, it looks like we have some new neighbors who like nothing better. Seems the Circle of Thorns have grabbed some of the Shard natives and are planning on doing something nasty. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to see the victims rescued from the Circle of Thorns</A>, but there's not a lot I can do against that kind of power."
// AcceptString :
"P3382946018" "Rescue sacrificial victims from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P1927859460" "You're a brave one, {HeroName}, and the lives of a number of people are riding on you. Your goal is going to be two-fold. First, you're going to need to rescue any captives the Circle's taken. Second, you'll need to blow whatever mystic altar thingie they're using sky-high to make sure their rituals fail. Saving lives and smashing things. I think that should fit your credentials pretty well."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2623604609" "Disrupt Circle Rituals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P280953936" "Remember, you need to rescue the victims and destroy the altar. I know you can handle it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2224300327" "You can hear the mystic chantings of the Circle of Thorns from deep within the caves."

