// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Flynn_KillTask1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3725970371" "The Nemesis Army have been making a real pain of themselves lately all over the Cascades. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This needs to be dealt with</A> before they start to get overconfidant. What do you say?"
// AcceptString :
"P1060468382" "Fight the Nemesis Army around the Cascades."
// SendOffString :
"P2354988218" "The directions are real easy on this one. Wherever you find the Nemesis Army lurking around the zone, beat them senseless. About 50 or so should get the message across."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P515515037" "Fight Nemesis in Cascades"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3378013550" "How's the battle against the Nemesis Army going?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P132636802" "{HeroName} sighted! For Lord Nemesis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3910071566" "You have diminished the power and confidence of the Nemesis Army in the Cascades"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3424618720" "That should teach those tin soldiers a lesson. Heh. <br>You know that the natives call Nemesis the 'Prince of Brass', and his Army the 'Brass-hearted devils'? Or did I already tell you that?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Flynn_KillTask2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P97382770" "The Circle of Thorns has been stepping up their work around the Cascades, and that's pretty much bad for everyone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This needs to be taken care of</A> before they can become get a major foothold out here."
// AcceptString :
"P4153834674" "Battle the Circle of Thorns around the Cascades."
// SendOffString :
"P3265365801" "The Circle's been sighted in a number of areas, so anyplace you can find them to fight is fine by me. Just take out about 50 of them, that should set them back some."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P43254649" "Battle the Circle around Cascades"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4212267265" "Have you finished thrashing the Circle yet? Don't keep me in suspense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3180713739" "Kill {HeroName} and all who oppose us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3478865203" "You have diminished the threat of the Circle of Thorns around the Cascades."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2358822602" "Those Circle of Thorns guys really get to me. It's good to know you got to them first. Thanks, {HeroName}."

